#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plot Estimator results {#plot-estimator-results}"
msgstr "Pag-plot ng mga resulta ng Estimator {#plot-estimator-results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit does not have a built-in function for plotting Estimator results, but you can use Matplotlib's [`bar` plot](https://matplotlib.org/stable/api/_as_gen/matplotlib.pyplot.bar.html) for a quick visualization.\n"
msgstr "Walang built-in na function ang Qiskit para sa pag-plot ng mga resulta ng Estimator, ngunit maaari kang gumamit ng [`bar` plot](https://matplotlib.org/stable/api/_as_gen/matplotlib.pyplot.bar.html) ng Matplotlib para sa mabilis na visualization.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To demonstrate, the following cell estimates the expectation values of seven different observables on a quantum state.\n"
msgstr "Para ipakita, tinatantya ng sumusunod na cell ang mga halaga ng expectation ng pitong iba't ibang observable sa isang quantum state.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/visualize-results/extracted-outputs/17c9893a-d1bf-4726-b444-6dce1d56805f-2.svg)\n"
