#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following cell uses the estimated [standard error](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Standard_error) of each result and adds them as error bars. See the [`bar` plot documentation](https://matplotlib.org/stable/api/_as_gen/matplotlib.pyplot.bar.html) for a full description of the plot.\n"
msgstr "Ginagamit ng sumusunod na cell ang tinantiyang [standard error](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Standard_error) ng bawat resulta at idinaragdag ang mga ito bilang mga error bar. Tingnan ang [`bar` plot documentation](https://matplotlib.org/stable/api/_as_gen/matplotlib.pyplot.bar.html) para sa kumpletong paglalarawan ng plot.\n"

